      "changelog": "xiaozhi-physics-lab-coach v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release of the \"物理实验思维教练\" skill focused on building experimental thinking for physics.\n- Provides systematic frameworks for seven core experimental methods, data analysis, error analysis, and experiment evaluation.\n- Includes structured Socratic-questioning prompts to guide students from rote memorization to deep understanding of experimental design and reasoning.\n- Defines collaboration flows with related skills for error diagnosis, concept clarification, and student progress updates.\n- Specifies prohibited behaviors to ensure coaching stays inquiry-driven and student-centered.\n- Offers reporting templates, common error patterns, and reference guides for comprehensive experiment learning support.",
